  "paradigm_pack_notes": "Mewmao has amazing potential as a Synergist because it has a limited skillset consisting of Shell, Veil and the En- spells. Thus it can be customized to the player's liking with infusion. It has high HP and a decent Magic stat, making it an efficient endgame Synergist. Mewmao is commonly used to infuse the Resist Magic +36% ability, but along the way to that is the less-than-perfect HP +25% ability (the maximum is HP +30%). This 25% is relatively common, so if the same coincidental addition of a 25% reoccurs, it will become yellow-locked and require a third HP +25% to remove the lock.",
